classDiagram
    class PawPalApp {
        +collect_pet_tasks()
        +show_plan()
    }

    class PawPalAssistant {
        +generate_schedule(tasks, available_minutes)
    }

    class CareNoteRetriever {
        +retrieve(task_title, species)
    }

    class KnowledgeBase {
        +pet_care_notes.json
    }

    class Owner {
        +enter_pet_and_task_details()
        +review_schedule()
    }

    class Tests {
        +check_retrieval_and_planning()
    }

    PawPalApp --> PawPalAssistant : submits plan request
    PawPalAssistant --> CareNoteRetriever : retrieves per task
    CareNoteRetriever --> KnowledgeBase : searches
    PawPalAssistant --> PawPalApp : returns schedule and evidence
    Owner --> PawPalApp : enters details and reviews plan
    Tests ..> CareNoteRetriever : tests
    Tests ..> PawPalAssistant : tests
